{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 35, :comments ["<b>לי נקם ושלם.</b> Upon Me it is to take vengeance upon them and to repay them recompense of evil, and שלם is a noun, like ושלום:" "<b>לעת תמוט רגלם.</b> When the time arrives that their foot slips, I will repay them the punishment:" "<b>כי קרוב יום אידם.</b> And it is prepared in My hand to bring it upon them:" "<b>וחש עתידות למו.</b> The punishments destined to come upon them in their time — I will hasten them, as it is said: ״בעתה אחישנה״. And when will this sign be? ״כי ידין ה׳ עמו״ — when HaShem judges judgment with His people, and takes His vengeance and His claim from them:"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:01:55.765586593Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}